Hillsdale Academy is about developing  young people towards adulthood the true  liberal arts education is about raising  up young men and women to full humanity  they have been blessed with reason they  have been blessed with Souls what we  want to do is to help shape those  aspects that make them particularly and  beautifully human we want to focus on  those aspects to raise them up to be the  kinds of human beings the kinds of  adults we hope they would be first and  foremost of course the school is an  academic institution everything that  goes on in the classroom  is designed to help them develop the  kind of reason the minds that they ought  to have to strengthen the ability to  reason I get to teach kids science and I  get to teach it at a high level and I  know that from from top to bottom the  students are you know really getting  something out of it and we're not only  focused on you know them learning facts  we're trying to train them to really be  good thinkers we're simply going back to  the roots of who we are as Americans who  we are as a people as citizens living  under a constitution every Wednesday we  are gathered together for Chapel it  focuses our week it focuses our efforts  and our work our mission we can talk  about God we can talk about faith we can  actually look to Holy Scripture and that  is something that is not available in  most public schools the lessons learned  here are lessons that we aspire for our  kids to learn at home and they're  reinforced here those lessons of hard  work discipline character and a love of  learning those things are really  fostered here it's a very nice  experience because you learn more than  just academic skills you learn how to  how to build your character how to be  nice to people how you get along with  people when I think of the Academy it's  a very large portion of my life it  really feels like a family it's part of  how I grew up and it's part of all of my  friends that I made my classmates and I  we 