s were already  established through the help of many  good people in the staff with my  assistant Mike Roberts and so many of  the parents who were here and believed  in the mission of this school I felt  that together we were all able at that  point to move ahead and continue to  strengthen and to promote that important  mission I've been at the Academy this is  my 23rd year it's a wonderful place I've  had such joy over the years and  stability in my life knowing that I come  to such a special place every day  working with great kids great  administration and fellow teachers we've  been blessed with a great group of  people who have been able to maintain  the strong mission for for 25 years  truly remarkable
 

